adius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;schedules&lt;/b&gt;' style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5F6368;strokeWidth=1.7;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="890" y="292" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="890" y="432" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value='&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;submit&lt;/b&gt;' style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5F6368;strokeWidth=1.7;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="978" y="458" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1082" y="458" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c47" value='&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;register&lt;/b&gt;' style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5F6368;strokeWidth=1.7;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1258" y="458" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1360" y="458" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c48" value='&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;tables&lt;/b&gt;' style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5F6368;strokeWidth=1.7;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1230" y="536" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1230" y="830" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c49" value='&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;events, logs&lt;/b&gt;' style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5F6368;strokeWidth=1.7;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1200" y="536" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="660" y="830" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1200" y="770"/><mxPoint x="660" y="770"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c50" value='&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;create, delete&lt;/b&gt;' style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5F6368;strokeWidth=1.7;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="890" y="536" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="905" y="660" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="890" y="660"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" value="&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Ray job&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5F6368;strokeWidth=1.7;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1100" y="536" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1100" y="610" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c52" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5F6368;strokeWidth=1.7;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="572" y="856" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="518" y="856" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c53" value='&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;email&lt;/b&gt;' style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5F6368;strokeWidth=1.7;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="342" y="880" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="230" y="880" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c54" value='&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;pipewright retrain approve&lt;/b&gt;' style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5F6368;strokeWidth=1.7;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="230" y="574" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="630" y="536" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="630" y="574"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c55" value='&lt;b style="font-size:12px;color:#5F6368"&gt;OPTIONAL, FOR REGULATED ENVIRONMENTS&lt;/b&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;dashed=1;fillColor=#F8F9FA;strokeColor=#9AA0A6;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="1040" width="1290" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c56" value='&lt;b style="font-size:12px"&gt;Cloud KMS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11px;color:#5F6368"&gt;customer-managed keys&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9AA0A6;strokeWidth=1.2;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="342.0" y="1086" width="176" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c57" value="" style="shape=image;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;html=1;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="407" y="1092" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c58" value='&lt;b style="font-size:12px"&gt;VPC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11px;color:#5F6368"&gt;private networking&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9AA0A6;strokeWidth=1.2;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="572.0" y="1086" width="176" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c59" value="" style="shape=image;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;html=1;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="637" y="1092" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c60" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#202124&quot;&gt;Name a key and a network in the manifest's &lt;b&gt;security&lt;/b&gt; block and Pipewright applies them to every pipeline job, model, endpoint and BigQuery query. Run requests go over Pub/Sub, so the launcher can stay internal-only behind Private Service Connect and VPC Service Controls. Ray clusters join the network through a Private Service Connect interface.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="1090" width="740" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c61" value='&lt;p style="margin:0 0 6px"&gt;&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Publish.&lt;/b&gt; The platform team builds the environment and publishes the environment manifest.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin:0 0 6px"&gt;&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Release.&lt;/b&gt; The ML team releases: images and templates pinned by digest, and a write-once contract.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin:0 0 6px"&gt;&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Trigger.&lt;/b&gt; Files, schedules and run requests reach the shared launcher.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin:0 0 6px"&gt;&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Run.&lt;/b&gt; The launcher submits pipelines to Agent Platform as the team&amp;#x27;s own identity; a Ray step gets its own cluster.&lt;/p&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#202124;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1210" width="760" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c62" value='&lt;p style="margin:0 0 6px"&gt;&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Store.&lt;/b&gt; Pipelines write the team&amp;#x27;s tables and register models; the default version is the champion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin:0 0 6px"&gt;&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Signal.&lt;/b&gt; Events and logs become email alerts and decision emails.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin:0 0 6px"&gt;&lt;span style="background:#0B6B67;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:bold"&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Decide.&lt;/b&gt; On drift, approvers approve, decline or snooze; an approved retrain runs.&lt;/p&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#202124;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="1210" width="750" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c63" value='&lt;span style="color:#5F6368"&gt;Icons: the official Google Cloud set. Agent Platform services carry the Vertex AI icon (Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform was called Vertex AI until April 2026).&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#202124;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1340" width="1500" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
